{"id":1130602,"name":"린·심문 II","type":"Interrogation","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"린·심문 II","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1130602]}],"trial":{"trial_id":130602,"stage":"2단계","unlock_time":"2023-04-11 14:00:00","diary1":"외출 허가를 받은 당신은 오랜만에 보는 풍경이 린의 응어리를 풀어주길 바라며 그녀를 데리고 신디케이트로 가서 바람을 쐬기로 했다.","diary2":"린의 카메라를 통해 당신은 신디케이트의 다른 모습을 보게 됐고, 린의 소중한 친구인 누렁이도 알게 됐다. 하지만 이것들로도 린이 헬멧을 벗게 할 수는 없었다.\n　　그래서 당신은 족쇄를 이용해 린의 능력을 제거하고 잠시 평범한 여자아이로 돌아가게 해 린이 다시 시작할 수 있다는 걸 깨닫게 했다. 린은 마침내 용기 사탕을 먹고 당신에게 열심히 분발하고 싶다고 했다.","evidence":[{"ID":260323,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260324,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":3,"dialogue_id":230602013,"next":[14]},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":230602022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id":